+    /*
+     * Cornix TB local patch: on transition back to the ACTIVE activity state
+     * (key press / movement after idle/sleep), kick start_scanning() again.
+     * Previously, if start_scanning failed at boot or scanning got stopped
+     * during sleep, there was no path back to scanning without a hard reset.
+     * Calling start_scanning here is idempotent: it returns 0 immediately
